Subject: [PATCH] adbd: Support the legacy Android USB character device

Change-Id: Iaeb7281726185d0e7b29c04d7f227daaba23529d
---
 adb/Android.mk      |   6 ++
 adb/daemon/main.cpp |   4 ++
 adb/daemon/usb.cpp  | 140 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 adb/daemon/usb.h    |   5 ++
